Package: plotphotos
Type: Package
Title: Copy and Rename JPEGs by Nearest Plot Locality ID
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Josef", "Brůna", email = "josef.bruna@ibot.cas.cz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Copies (does not move) JPEG/JPG files from one or more input folders,
    extracts EXIF GPS when available, assigns each photo to the nearest plot locality_id,
    and copies into a flattened output structure. Photos without GPS are skipped by default,
    but can still be copied when either (a) the filename already begins with a locality_id
    (names=TRUE) or (b) the parent folder name equals a locality_id (folders=TRUE).
    Output naming avoids conflicts across multiple runs by checking existing files.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    sf,
    exifr,
    units
Suggests:
    roxygen2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    devtools,
    usethis
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
